        "id": "0a110000-0000-4000-8000-000000000017",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "Right to rent: before the tenancy starts we must check that every adult who will live in the property has the right to rent in the UK. We will ask to see original documents, or a share code if you have one, and keep a copy.",
